, and said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto him, Hath not the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" God","strong":"H430"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":" commanded","strong":"H6680"},{"text":", [saying], Go","strong":"H3212"},{"text":" and draw","strong":"H4900"},{"text":" toward mount","strong":"H2022"},{"text":" Tabor","strong":"H8396"},{"text":", and take","strong":"H3947"},{"text":" with thee ten","strong":"H6235"},{"text":" thousand","strong":"H505"},{"text":" men","strong":"H376"},{"text":" of the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Naphtali","strong":"H5321"},{"text":" and of the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Zebulun","strong":"H2074"},{"text":"?"}]},{"id":6606,"title":"Judges 4:7","segments":["And I will draw unto thee to the river Kishon Sisera, the captain of Jabin's army, with his chariots and his multitude; and I will deliver him into thine hand."],"ref":"Judges 4:7","verse":7,"words":[{"text":"And I will draw","strong":"H4900"},{"text":" unto thee to the river","strong":"H5158"},{"text":" Kishon","strong":"H7028"},{"text":" Sisera","strong":"H5516"},{"text":", the captain","strong":"H8269"},{"text":" of Jabin's","strong":"H2985"},{"text":" army","strong":"H6635"},{"text":", with his chariots","strong":"H7393"},{"text":" and his multitude","strong":"H1995"},{"text":"; and I will deliver","strong":"H5414"},{"text":" him into thine hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":6607,"title":"Judges 4:8","segments":["And Barak said unto her, If thou wilt go with me, then I will go: but if thou wilt not go with me, [then] I will not go."],"ref":"Judges 4:8","verse":8,"words":[{"text":"And Barak","strong":"H1301"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto her, If thou wilt go","strong":"H3212"},{"text":" with me, then I will go","strong":"H1980"},{"text":": but if thou wilt not go","strong":"H3212"},{"text":" with me, [then] I will not go","strong":"H3212"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":6608,"title":"Judges 4:9","segments":["And she said, I will surely go with thee: notwithstanding the journey that thou takest shall not be for thine honour; for the LORD shall sell Sisera into the hand of a woman. And Deborah arose, and went with Barak to Kedesh."],"ref":"Judges 4:9","verse":9,"words":[{"text":"And she said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", I will surely","strong":"H1980"},{"text":" go","strong":"H3212"},{"text":" with thee: notwithstanding","strong":"H657"},{"text":" the journey","strong":"H1870"},{"text":" that thou takest","strong":"H1980"},{"text":" shall not be for thine honour","strong":"H8597"},{"text":"; for the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" shall sell","strong":"H4376"},{"text":" Sisera","strong":"H5516"},{"text":" into the hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":" of a woman","strong":"H802"},{"text":". And Deborah","strong":"H1683"},{"text":" arose","strong":"H6965"},{"text":", and went","strong":"H3212"},{"text":" with Barak","strong":"H1301"},{"text":" to Kedesh","strong":"H6943"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":6609,"title":"Judges 4:10","segments":["¶And Barak called Zebulun and Naphtali to Kedesh; and he went up with ten thousand men at his feet: and Deborah went up with him."],"ref":"Judges 4:10","verse":10,"words":[{"text":"¶And Barak","strong":"H1301"},{"text":" called","strong":"H2199"},{"text":" Zebulun","strong":"H2074"},{"text":" and Naphtali","strong":"H5321"},{"text":" to Kedesh","strong":"H6943"},{"text":"; and he went up","strong":"H5927"},{"text":" with ten","strong":"H6235"},{"text":" thousand","strong":"H505"},{"text":" men","strong":"H376"},{"text":" at his feet","strong":"H7272"},{"text":": and Deborah","strong":"H1683"},{"text":" went up","strong":"H5927"},{"text":" with him."}]},{"id":6610,"title":"Judges 4:11","segments":["Now Heber the Kenite, [which was] of the children of Hobab the father in law of Moses, had severed himself from the Kenites, and pitched his tent unto the plain of Zaanaim, which [is] by Kedesh."],"ref":"Judges 4:11","verse":11,"words":[{"text":"Now Heber","strong":"H2268"},{"text":" the Kenite","strong":"H7017"},{"text":", [which was] of the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Hobab","strong":"H2246"},{"text":" the father in law","strong":"H2859"},{"text":" of Moses","strong":"H4872"},{"text":", had severed","strong":"H6504"},{"text":" himself from the Kenites","strong":"H7017"},{"text":", and pitched","strong":"H5186"},{"text":" his tent","strong":"H168"},{"text":" unto the plain","strong":"H436"},{"text":" of Zaanaim","strong":"H6815"},{"text":", which [is] by Kedesh","strong":"H6943"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":6611,"title":"Judges 4:12","segments":["And they shewed Sisera that Barak the son of Abinoam was gone up to mount Tabor."],"ref":"Judges 4:12","verse":12,"words":[{"text":"And they shewed","strong":"H5046"},{"text":" Sisera","strong":"H5516"},{"text":" that Barak","strong":"H1301"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Abinoam","strong":"H42"},{"text":" was gone up","strong":"H5927"},{"text":" to mount","strong":"H2022"},{"text":" Tabor","strong":"H8396"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":6612,"title":"Judges 4:13","segments":["And Sisera gathered together all his chariots, [even] nine hundred chariots of iron, and all the people that [were] with him, from Harosheth of the Gentiles unto the river of Kishon. {together: Heb. by cry, or, proclamation}"],"ref":"Judges 4:13","verse":13,"words":[{"text":"And Sisera","strong":"H5516"},{"text":" gathered together","strong":"H2199"},{"text":" all his chariots","strong":"H7393"},{"text":", [even] nine","strong":"H8672"},{"text":" hundred","strong":"H3967"},{"text":" chariots","strong":"H7393"},{"text":" of iron","strong":"H1270"},{"text":", and all the people","strong":"H5971"},{"text":" that [were] with him, from Harosheth","strong":"H2800"},{"text":" of the Gentiles","strong":"H1471"},{"text":" unto the river","strong":"H5158"},{"text":" of Kishon","strong":"H7028"},{"text":". {together: Heb. by cry, or, proclamation}"}]},{"id":6613,"title":"Judges 4:14","segments":["And De