But Barak pursued after the chariots, and after the host, unto Harosheth of the Gentiles: and all the host of Sisera fell upon the edge of the sword; [and] there was not a man left. {a man: Heb. unto one}"],"ref":"Judges 4:16","verse":16,"words":[{"text":"But Barak","strong":"H1301"},{"text":" pursued","strong":"H7291"},{"text":" after","strong":"H310"},{"text":" the chariots","strong":"H7393"},{"text":", and after the host","strong":"H4264"},{"text":", unto Harosheth","strong":"H2800"},{"text":" of the Gentiles","strong":"H1471"},{"text":": and all the host","strong":"H4264"},{"text":" of Sisera","strong":"H5516"},{"text":" fell","strong":"H5307"},{"text":" upon the edge","strong":"H6310"},{"text":" of the sword","strong":"H2719"},{"text":"; [and] there was not a man","strong":"H259"},{"text":" left","strong":"H7604"},{"text":". {a man: Heb. unto one}"}]},{"id":6616,"title":"Judges 4:17","segments":["¶Howbeit Sisera fled away on his feet to the tent of Jael the wife of Heber the Kenite: for [there was] peace between Jabin the king of Hazor and the house of Heber the Kenite."],"ref":"Judges 4:17","verse":17,"words":[{"text":"¶Howbeit Sisera","strong":"H5516"},{"text":" fled away","strong":"H5127"},{"text":" on his feet","strong":"H7272"},{"text":" to the tent","strong":"H168"},{"text":" of Jael","strong":"H3278"},{"text":" the wife","strong":"H802"},{"text":" of Heber","strong":"H2268"},{"text":" the Kenite","strong":"H7017"},{"text":": for [there was] peace","strong":"H7965"},{"text":" between Jabin","strong":"H2985"},{"text":" the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Hazor","strong":"H2674"},{"text":" and the house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":" of Heber","strong":"H2268"},{"text":" the Kenite","strong":"H7017"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":6617,"title":"Judges 4:18","segments":["And Jael went out to meet Sisera, and said unto him, Turn in, my lord, turn in to me; fear not. And when he had turned in unto her into the tent, she covered him with a mantle. {mantle: or, rug, or, blanket}"],"ref":"Judges 4:18","verse":18,"words":[{"text":"And Jael","strong":"H3278"},{"text":" went out","strong":"H3318"},{"text":" to meet","strong":"H7125"},{"text":" Sisera","strong":"H5516"},{"text":", and said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto him, Turn in","strong":"H5493"},{"text":", my lord","strong":"H113"},{"text":", turn in","strong":"H5493"},{"text":" to me; fear","strong":"H3372"},{"text":" not. And when he had turned in","strong":"H5493"},{"text":" unto her into the tent","strong":"H168"},{"text":", she covered","strong":"H3680"},{"text":" him with a mantle","strong":"H8063"},{"text":". {mantle: or, rug, or, blanket}"}]},{"id":6618,"title":"Judges 4:19","segments":["And he said unto her, Give me, I pray thee, a little water to drink; for I am thirsty. And she opened a bottle of milk, and gave him drink, and covered him."],"ref":"Judges 4:19","verse":19,"words":[{"text":"And he said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto her, Give me, I pray thee, a little","strong":"H4592"},{"text":" water","strong":"H4325"},{"text":" to drink","strong":"H8248"},{"text":"; for I am thirsty","strong":"H6770"},{"text":". And she opened","strong":"H6605"},{"text":" a bottle","strong":"H4997"},{"text":" of milk","strong":"H2461"},{"text":", and gave him drink","strong":"H8248"},{"text":", and covered","strong":"H3680"},{"text":" him."}]},{"id":6619,"title":"Judges 4:20","segments":["Again he said unto her, Stand in the door of the tent, and it shall be, when any man doth come and enquire of thee, and say, Is there any man here? that thou shalt say, No."],"ref":"Judges 4:20","verse":20,"words":[{"text":"Again he said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto her, Stand in","strong":"H5975"},{"text":" the door","strong":"H6607"},{"text":" of the tent","strong":"H168"},{"text":", and it shall be, when any man","strong":"H376"},{"text":" doth come","strong":"H935"},{"text":" and enquire","strong":"H7592"},{"text":" of thee, and say","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Is there","strong":"H3426"},{"text":" any man","strong":"H376"},{"text":" here","strong":"H3426"},{"text":"? that thou shalt say","strong":"H559"},{"text":", No."}]},{"id":6620,"title":"Judges 4:21","segments":["Then Jael Heber's wife took a nail of the tent, and took an hammer in her hand, and went softly unto him, and smote the nail into his temples, and fastened it into the ground: for he was fast asleep and weary. So he died. {and took: Heb. and put}"],"ref":"Judges 4:21","verse":21,"words":[{"text":"Then Jael","strong":"H3278"},{"text":" Heber's","strong":"H2268"},{"text":" wife","strong":"H802"},{"text":" took","strong":"H3947"},{"text":" a nail","strong":"H3489"},{"text":" of the tent","strong":"H168"},{"text":", and took","strong":"H7760"},{"text":" an hammer","strong":"H4718"},{"text":" in her hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":", and went","strong":"H935"},{"text":" softly","strong":"H3814"},{"text":" unto him, and smote","strong":"H8628"},{"text":" the nail","strong":"H3489"},{"text":" into his temples","strong":"H7541"},{"text":", and fastened","strong":"H6795"},{"text":" it into the ground","strong":"H776"},{"text":": for he was fast asleep","strong":"H7290"},{"text":" and weary","strong":"H5774"},{"text":". So he died","strong":"H4191"},{"text":". {and took: Heb. and put}"}]},{"id":6621,"title":"Judges 4:22","segments":["And, behold, as Barak pursued Sisera, Jael came out to meet him, and said unto him, Come, and I will shew thee the man whom thou seekest. And when he came into her [tent], behold, Sisera lay dead, and the nail [was] in his temples."],"ref":"Judges 4:22","verse":22,"words":[{"text":"And, behold, as Barak","strong":"H1301"},{"text":" pursued","strong":"H7291"},{"text":" Sisera","strong":"H5516"},{"text":", Jael","strong":"H3278"},{"text":" came out","strong":"H3318"},{"text":" to meet","strong":"H7125"},{"text":" him, and said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto him, Come","strong":"H3212"},{"text":", and I will shew","strong":"H7200"},{"text":" thee the man","strong":"H376"},{"text":" whom thou seekest","strong":"H1245"},{"text":". And when he came","strong":"H935"},{"text":" into her [tent], behold, Sisera","strong":"H5516"},{"text":" lay","strong":"H5307"},{"text":" dead","strong":"H4191"},{"text":", and the nail","strong":"H3489"},{"text":" [was] in his temples","strong":"H7541"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":6622,"title":"Judges 4:23","segments":["So God subdued on that day Jabin the king of Canaan before the children of Israel."],"ref":"Judges 4:23","verse":23,"words":[{"text":"So God","strong":"H430"},{"text":" subdued","strong":"H3665"},{"text":" on that day","strong":"H3117"},{"text":" Jabin","strong":"H2985"},{"text":" the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Canaan","strong":"H3667"},{"text":" before","strong":"H6440"},{"text":" the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":6623,"title":"Judges 4:24","segments":["And the hand of the children of Israel prospered, and prevailed against Jabin the king of Canaan, until they had destroyed Jabin king of Canaan. {prospered...: Heb. going went and was hard}"],"ref":"Judges 4:24","verse":24,"words":[{"text":"And the hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":" of the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":" prospered","strong":"H3212"},{"text":"","strong":"H1980"},{"text":", and prevailed","strong":"H7186"},{"text":" against Jabin","strong":"H2985"},{"text":" the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Canaan","strong":"H3667"},{"text":", until they had destroyed","strong":"H3772"},{"text":" Jabin","strong":"H2985"},{"text":" king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Canaan","strong":"H3667"},{"text":". {prospered...: Heb. going went and was hard}"}]}]}
